<DocsLayout title="batze docs — Invoicing" description="Create Swiss QR-bills, send invoices, and track payments in batze.">
  <h1>Invoicing</h1>
  <p>Create a Swiss-compliant invoice in seconds, send it, and let batze keep track of what's been paid.</p>

  <h2 id="qr-bills">Swiss QR-bills</h2>
  <p>
    Every invoice can include a <strong>QR-bill</strong> that follows the Swiss QR-bill standard, so your clients can
    scan and pay it directly from their banking app. Your IBAN/QR-IBAN and address are filled in from your settings.
  </p>

  <h2 id="from-projects">From tracked time</h2>
  <p>
    If the work lives in a <a href="/docs/projects">project</a>, batze can turn its billable hours into a draft
    invoice in one step — no re-typing line items.
  </p>

  <h2 id="reminders">Payment tracking & reminders</h2>
  <p>
    Mark invoices as sent and paid, see what's overdue at a glance, and let batze send polite reminders on a schedule
    you choose.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
